# Flutter Rust bridge codegen output.
#
# The bindings are committed on purpose. They are derived from
# `crates/rd-engine/src/flutter_ffi.rs` by scripts/flutter/generate-bridge.sh,
# but `flutter_rust_bridge_codegen` needs a full Dart toolchain and every job
# that has to compile this crate runs without one -- the Windows host build
# today, the Flutter shells next. While these were ignored, `cargo fmt` failed
# first, because rustfmt resolves every `mod` regardless of enabled features, so
# the crate could not be formatted, tested or built anywhere that had not
# already run codegen by hand.
#
# After any change to `flutter_ffi.rs`, rerun scripts/flutter/generate-bridge.sh
# and commit the regenerated bindings in the same change.
crates/rd-engine/flutter_bridge/generated_bridge.freezed.dart
crates/rd-engine/flutter_bridge/.dart_tool/
crates/rd-engine/.dart_tool/
